451
00:39:13,338 --> 00:39:17,538
BANG BANG BANG 狙って BANG BANG BANG 外さない CLEAR
BANG BANG BANG, take aim, BANG BANG BANG, I don't miss, CLEAR

452
00:39:17,638 --> 00:39:21,638
イイ線行ってんだってランエガ しばしばルイは友を呼ぶ
You're on the right track, Run Egar, birds of a feather flock together

453
00:39:21,638 --> 00:39:25,838
威勢良く迫って BANG BANG BANG 捕らわれず COVER
Pressing aggressively, BANG BANG BANG, uncaptured, COVER

454
00:39:25,838 --> 00:39:29,938
日々こうやって気取ってさ出番
Daily posing like this, it's my turn

455
00:39:29,938 --> 00:39:32,038
爪を剥き出し
Baring my claws

456
00:39:32,138 --> 00:39:38,338
一見 高貴な企業もどきと 侮るのなら
If you look down on us as seemingly noble fake corporate types,

457
00:39:38,338 --> 00:39:45,438
立ち外れて容赦なく 手短くなってやば殺される
Out of line, without mercy, cut short, perilously dispatched

458
00:39:45,438 --> 00:39:49,938
本気か増しか弱音なんてすぐ眠れ
Are you serious or better off, go to sleep with your complaints immediately

459
00:39:50,138 --> 00:39:54,738
混じり気ないハートビート 揺らすこの世界
Pure heartbeat shaking this world

460
00:39:54,738 --> 00:39:59,938
咲いて果てど泥にまみれて明日かね
Blooming to the end, covered in mud, tomorrow maybe?

461
00:39:59,938 --> 00:40:01,138
裏の裏までいただきじゃん
Taking it all, down to the inside out

462
00:40:00,753 --> 00:40:03,153
いつだったって目立ったら笑顔
Whenever I stood out, a smile was there.

463
00:40:03,153 --> 00:40:06,253
今だに縫い目は今日も呼ぶ息を
Even now, the seams draw in a breath today,

464
00:40:06,253 --> 00:40:08,953
寄せては
pulling closer...

465
00:40:08,953 --> 00:40:11,353
さとられず Cover
Unnoticed, I cover it up.

466
00:40:11,353 --> 00:40:14,353
意味通り気取って去っては
Acting cool just as intended before slipping away,

467
00:40:14,353 --> 00:40:17,153
通りに乗っ立つ
standing tall on the street.

468
00:40:26,653 --> 00:40:29,653
今日も秘密の Day out
Today is another secret day out.

469
00:40:42,653 --> 00:40:45,153
ラストはこの曲です！
This is the last song!

470
00:40:46,653 --> 00:40:49,153
皆さん聴いてください、魔眼ウインク！
Everyone, please listen: "Magan Wink"!

471
00:40:54,953 --> 00:40:58,353
So here, to be late...

472
00:41:01,153 --> 00:41:03,153
Do you remember me?

473
00:41:06,353 --> 00:41:08,353
シャルムな目元 メイクアップ
Charming eyes, made up,

474
00:41:08,353 --> 00:41:10,653
捉え捉え捕まった
caught and held fast,

475
00:41:10,653 --> 00:41:12,853
ナイスな目元 真っ赤っ赤
nice eyes glowing bright red.

476
00:41:12,853 --> 00:41:15,653
それはウインク ウインク
That's a wink, a wink!

477
00:41:15,653 --> 00:41:17,753
逃げてもずっと捕まえ
Even if you run, holding you tight,

478
00:41:17,753 --> 00:41:20,653
クレイジーな台風の目
in the crazy eye of the storm.

479
00:41:20,653 --> 00:41:21,653
ウインク
Wink!

480
00:41:21,653 --> 00:41:24,653
冗談目論見デカい 目に入れたって痛くないくらい
Big jokes and grand schemes, so close it doesn't even hurt to look,

481
00:41:24,653 --> 00:41:28,153
口ばしに Miss revenge
Miss Revenge at the ready.

482
00:41:28,153 --> 00:41:31,153
仇返しなら 得意にしてた
Getting payback was always my specialty.

483
00:41:31,153 --> 00:41:33,653
怖がってんの？ あっそ
Are you scared? Oh, really?

484
00:41:34,153 --> 00:41:37,153
それ見たことか
See, what did I tell you?

485
00:41:38,153 --> 00:41:41,153
まだまだ
Not yet, not yet!

486
00:41:42,153 --> 00:41:44,353
安全じゃないから
Because it's not safe,

487
00:41:44,353 --> 00:41:46,653
健全じゃないから
because it's not wholesome.

488
00:41:46,653 --> 00:41:49,153
それがどうしたんだ Party
What about it? It's a party!

489
00:41:49,153 --> 00:41:51,653
誰？ 目には目を
Who's that? An eye for an eye!

490
00:41:51,653 --> 00:41:53,753
ウィンク
Wink!

491
00:41:53,753 --> 00:41:57,953
See la la la la, be secret la la, give me a wink

492
00:41:57,953 --> 00:42:00,153
See la la la la, や真っ赤っ赤
See la la la la, turned bright red!

493
00:42:00,153 --> 00:42:03,153
OH, I, I, I want youで バイバイ安泰
OH, I, I, I want you, bye-bye to peaceful safety!

494
00:42:03,153 --> 00:42:06,953
目移り目移る My eye eye
Glances wavering, my eye eye.

495
00:42:06,953 --> 00:42:09,653
いいよ 目をつぶる半分ね
It's fine, I'll close my eyes halfway,

496
00:42:09,653 --> 00:42:11,953
魔眼ウインク
with a Magic Eye Wink.

497
00:42:21,953 --> 00:42:24,353
ほらほら 瞬く間に
Look, look, in the blink of an eye,

498
00:42:24,353 --> 00:42:26,653
I, I, I kill you, Wink

499
00:42:27,153 --> 00:42:29,953
後ろ指 刺したいならお好きにどうぞ
If you want to point fingers behind my back, go right ahead.

500
00:42:29,953 --> 00:42:33,953
どうせ 振り返らん処置の残滓
After all, these remnants of measures won't look back.

501
00:42:33,953 --> 00:42:37,153
お待たせ 迅速迅速 おさらばお恨みっこ
Thanks for waiting, swift and quick, farewell to holding grudges!

502
00:42:37,153 --> 00:42:39,653
霊光な直感 Remember
Bright spiritual intuition, remember.

503
00:42:39,653 --> 00:42:43,953
I'm coming back, coming back, coming back

504
00:42:43,953 --> 00:42:46,953
目じゃない 眼中にない
Out of sight, out of mind!

505
00:42:46,953 --> 00:42:48,953
そうさ 善良じゃないだろ
That's right, it's not virtuous, is it?

506
00:42:48,953 --> 00:42:51,353
裁量じゃないだろ
It's not up to discretion, is it?

507
00:42:51,353 --> 00:42:53,953
それがどうしたんだ Party
What about it? It's a party!

508
00:42:53,953 --> 00:42:58,153
誰？ 目には目を 歯には歯を
Who's that? An eye for an eye, a tooth for a tooth!

509
00:43:03,953 --> 00:43:07,153
類は何を呼ぶ
What do birds of a feather flock together for?

510
00:43:07,153 --> 00:43:10,153
刹那的羽ばたきを知るウィン
Knowing the fleeting flutter of wings, win!

511
00:43:10,153 --> 00:43:13,353
目が離せない
I can't take my eyes off!

512
00:43:13,353 --> 00:43:15,153
完璧なウィンク
A perfect wink!

513
00:43:15,153 --> 00:43:19,653
See la la la la, be secret la la, give me a wink

514
00:43:19,653 --> 00:43:21,953
See la la la la, や真っ赤っ赤
See la la la la, turned bright red!

515
00:43:21,953 --> 00:43:25,153
OH, I, I, I want youで バイバイ安泰
OH, I, I, I want you, bye-bye to peaceful safety!

516
00:43:25,153 --> 00:43:28,153
目移り目移る My eye eye
Glances wavering, my eye eye.

517
00:43:28,153 --> 00:43:32,153
もう目が離せない Eye eye eye
Can't take my eyes off anymore, eye eye eye!

518
00:43:32,153 --> 00:43:34,653
魔眼ウインク
Magic Eye Wink!

519
00:43:42,153 --> 00:43:45,653
ほらほら 瞬く間に
Look, look, in the blink of an eye,

520
00:43:45,653 --> 00:43:48,653
I, I, I, I kill you

521
00:43:54,153 --> 00:43:55,353
Wink!

