00:46:45,368 --> 00:46:50,868
マリン先輩とやった『ばかばっか』、『FIRST CRY』、『CHARISMA』、『オーバーロード』、『Tori To Re:TreaT』...
"Baka Bakka" with Marine-senpai, "FIRST CRY", "CHARISMA", "OVERLOAD", "Tori To Re:TreaT"...

